How to download/install and setup jenkins?
download jenkins from oficial website 
Start installing jenkins
Go to http://localhost:8080
one location patch it will give:C:\ProgramData\Jenkins\.jenkins\secrets\initialAdminPassword

From there we need to take password and add in that screen->Continue->click on first option install sugested plugins then it will install all plugins.

We can set username and password-->save an continue

Install plugins in jenkins:
Go to http://localhost:8080
Manage Jenkins
Available plugins
search junit->Select maven integration->install
Allure report--install
nodejs--install

we can see installed plugins under installed plugins tab

Go to tools under Manage Jenkins we can update multiple versions of noe.js if want

Add PAT in Jenkins:
Go to Jenkins->Manage Jenkins->Securiry->credentials--global->add credentials---specify username with password(PAT) an description ID will be generated by jenkins after save credentials.

