Add Reports in Jenkins as Artifacts:
Open jenkins->our folder->Configure->PostBuildActions->Add Post build Actions->Add Archiceve artifacts->Add path of Reports folder(playwright-report/**)

How to add JUnit report in jenkins?

open jenkins->your folder->onfigure->Post bui Actions->Ad post buil action->Add publish Junit report->add this (from playwright config file) Junit-test-report.xml-->Apply and Save.
once build copleted,we can see Tests option at left panel when we click build-->click and see report.

How to add Allure Reports in Jenkins?
open jenkins->your folder->onfigure->Post bui Actions->Ad post buil action->Add allure report->once we select we can see new section created at top with Allure->pas allure-results-->Apply and Save.
we can see report after clicking on build.

